+- Line ~32: `FIREBASE_AUTH = SCRIPT_PROPS.getProperty("FIREBASE_AUTH") || "<literal>"`, the same leaked secret as the workflow. Invariants §1 rule 2: no hardcoded fallback credentials anywhere.
