+2. In the workflow `env:` block, change `FIREBASE_AUTH`, `SMARTTHINGS_PAT` and `SMARTTHINGS_DEVICE_ID` to read `${{ secrets.NAME }}` with no `||` fallback. Leave `FIREBASE_HOST` and `SMARTTHINGS_REFRESH_TOKEN` as they are.
